{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1467282-how-much-does-shadows-babble-daily","id":1467282,"title":"How much does shadows babble daily","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-09T12:57:19-08:00","id":1467282,"title":"How much does shadows babble daily","content":"Based on the books alone, it's difficult to tell how loud are shadows on a daily basis, on one side, nothing stop a shadow from being a non stop commentary machine, but on the other, it's difficult to imagine a whole society whose citizens are constantly listening to a voice in their head.<br /> <br /> In your canon, how much ae shadows present in wraith's daily unlives? A few comments or a continous stream?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-09T16:29:00-08:00","id":1467301,"title":"","content":"My personal preference is for it to vary depending on the Shadow's archetype, as well as how strong it is. Some are going to be more vocal than others, and some are going to be a lot more selective about when they decide to strike at the Psyche. A Director, for example, is going to bide its time planning for a surgical strike, as opposed to something like a Leech or a Monster, which will often try to wear the Psyche down through constant erosion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-10T06:12:49-08:00","id":1467346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1467282-how-much-does-shadows-babble-daily#post1467282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Based on the books alone, it's difficult to tell how loud are shadows on a daily basis, on one side, nothing stop a shadow from being a non stop commentary machine, but on the other, it's difficult to imagine a whole society whose citizens are constantly listening to a voice in their head.<br /> <br /> In your canon, how much ae shadows present in wraith's daily unlives? A few comments or a continous stream?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's a matter of the personality and power of the Shadow. They tend to get more talkative as they get more temporary Angst, and there's a faction of Helldivers that deliberately keep their Shadows full in case they slip up and reveal information <br /> <br /> Really, though, your best indication is your own dark side and neuroses. Those moments when your mind dredges up an old embarrassing memory, or when it seems like the world is against you, or when it seems so difficult to continue moving, or when you find yourself really raging against stupid people around you, etc. Basically, take all the aspects of your personality that you wish you didn't have and estimate how much and how often they affect your day. That's your rough answer, because that's the part of you that would become your Shadow if you lived in the WoD and became a wraith.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-10T15:18:59-08:00","id":1467384,"title":"","content":"I agree with both previous comments. There's definitely a baseline based on Shadow archetype - some Shadows will talk more and differently from one type to another. But permanent Angst is also important because that demonstrates the total power of the Shadow. <br /> <br /> At low levels of Angst, the Shadow is unlikely to speak often. The Psyche is suppressing it. But as its Angst increases, the Shadow is able to talk more. When permanent Angst reaches 10, the Shadow permanently takes control and the wraith becomes a spectre. So it makes sense that the Shadow is fairly active at high levels on Angst because it's winning its struggle against the Psyche. If Angst is 9, the Shadow is almost in complete control so it should be speaking very often. If it is only 1, maybe it's a few whispering comments at key moments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}